<title>FINLAND: ASKO SELLS UPO PUULAMPO.</title>
<headline>ASKO SELLS UPO PUULAMPO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish plastic pipes, white goods and furniture maker Asko Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it sold the shares of Upo Puulampo Oy to a company, of which Asko itself will hold a 19 percent stake.</p>
<p>Upo Puulampo's annual net sales are slightly over 40 million markka.</p>
<p>The divestment is part of Asko's strategy to focus on its core businesses.</p>
</text>
